// The temple (arch_temple at (160, 5, 221.75), its climbing collision arch_temple_town_col): up its
// stair onto the podium's front strip (8.6); a double jump and a grab onto the lower (pent) roof's
// front (z 210.75); on its strip outside the main roof's eave (z 211.75), a double jump and a grab
// onto the main roof; up it to below the top roof's eave
// (z 215.15); a double jump and a grab onto the top roof; up it and a jump onto the ridge (27.5);
// along the ridge to G5's take-off (172.5, 222.3).
